Module widow_patron "A widow's price" {
  Description "A woman whose son went after the raiders and did not come back puts her savings on their chief: dead or run, she does not care which.".
  Entity party: group "Your company".
  Place town "The settlement the raiders prey on" is room.
  // Where the raiders hold out: her word puts it on the company's map, somewhere to set out for.
  Place lair "Where the raiders hold out" is room.
  Entity chief: group "The raiders' chief".
  Entity band: group "The raiders".
  // Known by how she is seen: nobody tells a stranger her name. She takes the company as she takes everything now,
  // without tears: given no manner, she was grim by lot, and the Story had her go "back to work before you have
  // turned round" from the step she has not left (the cold evaluation).
  Person widow "the woman in black" at town {
    Role "a widow whose son went after the raiders". Ancestry human. Calling commoner. Level 1. Peaceable.
    Manner stoic. Pronouns she.
    State waiting "A woman in black sits on the step of a cold house with her hands in her lap, watching the road.".
  }
  Entity price: fact "A widow will pay her savings and her son's ring for the raiders' chief, dead or run off.".
  Initially Assert established(price).
  Initially Assert leadsTo(price, lair).
  Topic offer with widow "Ask the woman in black what she is waiting for" when true once {
    Says "'For somebody to go up there,' she says, looking toward {lair}, 'and do what my boy went to do.' She opens her hand: coins, and a ring. 'All I have, for {chief}. Dead or run, I don't care which. Just gone.'".
    On discuss { Assert knows(actor, price). }
  }
  Relation met(entity).
  Objective chief_price when knows(party, price) and not knows(party, paid_out) "A widow will pay her savings to see the raiders' chief dead or run off.".
  Rule chief_gone when (not able(chief) or routed(chief)) and not met(price) { Assert met(price). }
  Item ring "her son's ring" is grave_rings at town hidden until paid_out.
  Entity paid_out: fact "The widow has paid the company her savings and her son's ring.".
  Initially Assert established(paid_out).
  Topic claim with widow "Tell the woman in black it is done" when met(price) and knows(actor, price) once {
    Says "She doesn't cry. She counts the coins into your hand one at a time, and then puts the ring on top, and goes inside and shuts the door.".
    // Gone in, she is not on the step to be asked again what she is waiting for (the cold evaluation).
    On discuss { Increase quantity(actor, gold) by 15. Assert knows(actor, paid_out). Retract at(widow, town). }
  }
  Goal met(price) and knows(party, paid_out).
}
